Changes in version 1.1.1 (2025-11-11)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Changed the implementation of multiple correction testing methods and the
default to Benjamini-Hochberg.
- Added an error check for gene signatures containing repeated genes

Changes in version 0.99.3 (2025-10-22)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Simplified some visualization functions by converting them into wrappers
around functions from the henna package

